{
  "an8.29:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 8.29 ",
  "an8.29:0.2": "3. Gahapativagga ",
  "an8.29:0.3": "Akkhaṇasutta ",
  "an8.29:1.1": "“‘Khaṇakicco loko, khaṇakicco loko’ti, bhikkhave, assutavā puthujjano bhāsati, no ca kho so jānāti khaṇaṁ vā akkhaṇaṁ vā. ",
  "an8.29:1.2": "Aṭṭhime, bhikkhave, akkhaṇā asamayā brahmacariyavāsāya. ",
  "an8.29:1.3": "Katame aṭṭha? ",
  "an8.29:1.4": "Idha, bhikkhave, tathāgato ca loke uppanno hoti arahaṁ sammāsambuddho vijjācaraṇasampanno sugato lokavidū anuttaro purisadammasārathi satthā devamanussānaṁ buddho bhagavā, dhammo ca desiyati opasamiko parinibbāniko sambodhagāmī sugatappavedito; ",
  "an8.29:1.5": "ayañca puggalo nirayaṁ upapanno hoti. ",
  "an8.29:1.6": "Ayaṁ, bhikkhave, paṭhamo akkhaṇo asamayo brahmacariyavāsāya. ",
  "an8.29:2.1": "Puna caparaṁ, bhikkhave, tathāgato ca loke uppanno hoti …pe… satthā devamanussānaṁ buddho bhagavā, dhammo ca desiyati opasamiko parinibbāniko sambodhagāmī sugatappavedito; ",
  "an8.29:2.2": "ayañca puggalo tiracchānayoniṁ upapanno hoti …pe…. ",
  "an8.29:3.1": "Puna caparaṁ, bhikkhave …pe… ",
  "an8.29:3.2": "ayañca puggalo pettivisayaṁ upapanno hoti …pe…. ",
  "an8.29:4.1": "Puna caparaṁ, bhikkhave …pe… ",
  "an8.29:4.2": "ayañca puggalo aññataraṁ dīghāyukaṁ devanikāyaṁ upapanno hoti …pe…. ",
  "an8.29:5.1": "Puna caparaṁ, bhikkhave …pe… ",
  "an8.29:5.2": "ayañca puggalo paccantimesu janapadesu paccāj�